a('mar','8a:6','מר קשישא בריה דרב חסדא','speaker','density proposal');note('8a:6','Mar Kashisha speaks to Rav Ashi; Rav Ashi is not automatically a co-holder. Sixteen is too small and ensuing objection rejects lenient rounding.')
